docs {
  # Get User Groups (`GetUserGroups`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.GetUserGroups` in [group_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/group_handler.go)
  **Route**: `GET /api/_private/v1/groups/user/:userId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Retrieves all groups that the specified user belongs to by joining through `group_members`.
  
  ### URL Parameters
  - `userId` (string, path parameter): User ID (defaults to `{{userId}}`).
  
  ### Expected Response Structure
  ```json
  {
    "groups": [
      {
        "id": "group_abc123",
        "name": "Trip to Goa",
        "description": "Weekend getaway",
        "imageUrl": null,
        "simplifyDebts": true,
        "createdAt": "2026-09-29T10:00:00Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-29T10:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
